Humorous epithet for those who believe that a period should become mandatory before all cmevla in all contexts, as per ((The Case Against LA)).

Originally invented by ((rlpowell)), the idea was spun into [http://www.cafepress.com/logfest.81752213|a Cafepress t-shirt] by ((clsn)). (Note that the proceeds of t-shirt sales do NOT go to the LLG.)